      "content": "interesting. regarding that last point about demographics, specifically the mention of minority households—can u go into more detail there? like, how would we actually quantify that in a dataset to see if there's a statistically significant correlation with high-frequency claim areas? i'm trying to figure out which specific census categories would be most predictive for our model.",
